      "en": "Tamar put ashes on her head, and tore her garment of various colors that was on her; and she laid her hand on her head and went her way, crying aloud as she went.",
      "ko": "다말이 재를 그 머리에 무릅쓰고 그 채색옷을 찢고 손을 머리 위에 얹고 크게 울며 가니라",
      "source_text_hash": "273b1329e481a0c5b8dbe43931ef73f4cd5fe52bb3955b13ea1d1a08647e84c3",
      "translation_text_hash": "508473f6916b6f2b28788949bc81a6c9510f8cd13728d9eefb577b42dc0679fb",
