      "en": "Absalom spoke to Amnon neither good nor bad; for Absalom hated Amnon, because he had forced his sister Tamar.",
      "ko": "압살롬이 그 누이 다말을 암논이 욕되게 하였으므로 저를 미워하여 시비간에 말하지 아니하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "15a3a8017dad0f0e1ab1144973b271f15594feafb9f22c851d5a9e6067db8aea",
      "translation_text_hash": "3eebd11fe4b3fdf03376a1d6039aaabec1080b397db381950814689cf4a42475",
