      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 13,
          "verse": 31
        }
      ],
      "en": "Then the king arose, and tore his garments, and lay on the earth; and all his servants stood by with their clothes torn.",
      "ko": "왕이 곧 일어나서 그 옷을 찢고 땅에 엎드러지고 그 신복들도 다 옷을 찢고 모셔 선지라",
      "source_text_hash": "2287fc6c2a2c6932437859434ea51d098f0057282475df06ce1feef872017650",
      "translation_text_hash": "4ddcd8788cb1b153309f6ea704c1757251772038bc52cb8db04c116393bda358",
