      "en": "But Absalom fled. The young man who kept the watch lifted up his eyes and looked, and behold, many people were coming by way of the hillside behind him.",
      "ko": "이에 압살롬은 도망하니라 파수하는 소년이 눈을 들어 보니 뒷산 언덕길로 여러 사람이 오더라",
      "source_text_hash": "cda47f0498e41afad0a6451560fb39ed3710a37772e3288ec5ed13fbfa897542",
      "translation_text_hash": "299260e019d7a8ab6c6d3bf790c2aa2cb11d2a6eba4058d9649307c881b717a8",
