      "en": "As soon as he had finished speaking, behold, the king’s sons came, and lifted up their voices and wept. The king also and all his servants wept bitterly.",
      "ko": "말을 마치자 왕자들이 이르러 대성통곡하니 왕과 그 모든 신복도 심히 통곡하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "5594008e9b62d7c1ac585bfdb3a5c7829374cf8c3dfd35d8739386fe1383c7d5",
      "translation_text_hash": "02ce58a5436395302838edc783460da2e43176e964c4fb4b85e6ebe2fec5dfa8",
